<title>INDIA: India's RBI to hold four-day repos on January 29.</title>
<headline>India's RBI to hold four-day repos on January 29.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Monday it will conduct a four-day repos auction of government of India dated securities on January 29.</p>
<p>Bids will be accepted on January 29 up to 2.30 p.m and results announced the same evening, the RBI said in a statement. Payment by successful bidders will be on January 30 and the repurchase by the RBI on February 3, it added.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
